    "notes": "The photographed gates face the mapped public road approaches. The buildings follow the PMTiles footprints and the native roadway runs clear through the crossing. The model adds the terminal islands and exterior fences. The reconstruction represents the two passenger terminals and visible border gateways. Window divisions, roof details, signage ornament and service equipment are interpreted from public imagery. Standard terrain controls the grades of the buildings and gate islands. The original mapped roadway and surrounding land use remain part of the native map."
